WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.700
- If I look different it's
because I'm not one and oh

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.563
as a fourth grade basketball coach.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:06.653
Breaking news!

00:00:06.653 --> 00:00:08.640
- [Announcer] This is CNN breaking news.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.410
- I don't think Michael Avenatti

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.100
is going to be president.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.690
Laugh if you will and you probably will,

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.830
but there were times
in 2018 where the idea

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.640
of a President Avenatti or at least

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.440
a democratic nominee Avenatti
wasn't any laughing matter.

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.750
Now the rise and apparent fall of Avenatti

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.740
is yes, a somewhat salacious story

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:30.470
of a lawyer for a porn
star using the megaphone

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:32.010
of cable TV to try to remake himself

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.860
into a credible candidate.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:34.693
That all happened.

00:00:34.693 --> 00:00:37.400
But it's also the story
of how fast you can rise

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.950
and how disastrously you can fall

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.210
in the modern political and media world.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.980
And it's a uniquely 2018
story about where we are

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.490
in politics and culture
at this depressing moment.

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:53.090
It's amazing to consider,
given his current ubiquity

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:56.940
but most people had never
heard the name Michael Avenatti

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.660
before this year and that's
not for want of trying.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.390
Avenatti is someone who has
always moved in powerful circles

00:01:02.390 --> 00:01:05.120
and valued that notoriety.

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.230
Now according to his
website, he has represented

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:10.360
Christina Aguilera as well
as Don Henley and Glenn Fry,

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.400
two founding members of
the rock band Eagles.

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.900
He's also handled litigation surrounding

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:21.090
the movie K19 The Widowmaker.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:23.370
Whatever that means.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.190
Sidebar, I didn't go to law school,

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.850
which technically means I'm not a lawyer.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:31.930
And yes my mother is still
disappointed in my decisions.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:32.820
Sorry mom!

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.530
But for our purposes
and more on the point,

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.940
Avenatti became a thing
in the spring of 2018

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.970
when he took on the case
of adult film actress

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.820
Stormy Daniels, also known
as Stephanie Clifford

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.210
who alleged that she and Trump

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:45.940
had an affair in the mid 2000s.

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.970
Now Daniels claimed that
she'd been paid $130,000

00:01:48.970 --> 00:01:51.290
by Trump's associate Michael Cohen

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.260
in the days just before the 2016 election

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:55.750
to keep quiet about those allegations.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:58.700
Avenatti quickly sued
Trump on Daniels behalf

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.010
in hopes of getting her free
from her non-disclosure deal.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:05.310
Then suddenly, Daniels was everywhere.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.190
And so was Avenatti, always at her side.

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.320
You couldn't turn on
cable TV, including CNN

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:13.200
without seeing Avenatti
insisting that he had the goods

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:16.680
on Cohen and Trump and brashly predicting

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.300
something, but always
it would all come out

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:22.310
on Trump and Cohen
sooner rather than later.

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:24.680
Now when the FBI conducted
a raid on Cohen's home,

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.370
hotel, and office in April,
they seized thousands

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.780
of documents and they put
Trumps personal lawyer

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:32.260
and fixer at the center of the ongoing

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:34.580
Russia interference investigation.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:38.440
It sure did seem like Avenatti
had predicted the future.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.010
And because he's Avenatti, he wasn't shy

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.140
about tooting his own horn.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.917
Here's Avenatti soon after
the Cohen raid, quote,

00:02:44.917 --> 00:02:47.337
"To those that scoffed
when we filed this case

00:02:47.337 --> 00:02:49.827
"and claimed it was all about dollar sign:

00:02:49.827 --> 00:02:52.247
"As we predicted and
as the FBI raid shows,

00:02:52.247 --> 00:02:55.627
"Mr. Cohen and Mr. Trump
are in a lot of trouble.

00:02:55.627 --> 00:02:57.527
"It has always been about the threats,

00:02:57.527 --> 00:02:59.267
"coverup and the lies that have been

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:01.940
"told to the American people."

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.250
End quote.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.400
Then as spring turned to summer,

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.250
Avenatti's TV presence only increased.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.350
What he was talking about
actually started to change though.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:12.950
No longer was Avenatti simply
defending Daniels right

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:16.670
to be free from her hush
agreement with Cohen and Trump,

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.500
suddenly he was casting
himself as the only person

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:24.500
in the country willing and able
to stand up to Donald Trump.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.720
At then, suddenly, it happened.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.750
In response to a maybe
joking tweet on July 4th

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.000
about when he was announcing his 2020 bid,

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.617
Avenatti tweeted this, and I quote,

00:03:35.617 --> 00:03:39.687
"If parenthesis big he seeks
re-election, I will run,

00:03:39.687 --> 00:03:41.957
"but only if I think there
is no other candidate

00:03:41.957 --> 00:03:44.737
"in the race that has a
real chance at beating him.

00:03:44.737 --> 00:03:46.617
"We can't relive 2016.

00:03:46.617 --> 00:03:49.017
"I love this country, our
values, and our people

00:03:49.017 --> 00:03:52.197
"too much to sit by
while they are destroyed.

00:03:52.197 --> 00:03:55.200
"Hashtag fight club."

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:56.033
What?

00:03:56.970 --> 00:03:58.900
Of course with Donald Trump, reality star,

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:00.900
gossip tabloid foddery and recent convert

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:03.060
to the Republican Party,
in the White House,

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:05.820
who could rule out the idea
of a man who became famous

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.290
for representing a porn star,
who said she had an affair

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:09.440
with the President of the United States

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:11.480
running against that same President.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.790
In some ways it's a perfect storyline.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.220
Avenatti went to Iowa.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.680
Avenatti went to New Hampshire.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.410
Avenatti started a political organization

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.760
to donate to Democratic
candidates and most importantly

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:25.750
of all, Avenatti talked tough, real tough.

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:30.750
- So I say, when they
go low, we hit harder.

00:04:31.349 --> 00:04:32.490
(cheering)

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:33.867
- This fall he said this, quote,

00:04:33.867 --> 00:04:35.257
"We cannot afford to show up

00:04:35.257 --> 00:04:38.530
"to the fight without a slingshot."

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:39.600
End quote.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:42.500
Now even as Avenatti was
rising from celebrity

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:45.010
lawyer to probably
candidate for president,

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.830
there were some warning
signs that his rapid ascent

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:50.061
might have glossed over a few problems

00:04:50.061 --> 00:04:52.610
from his past and present.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.190
In July, Avenatti paid the
Internal Revenue Service

00:04:55.190 --> 00:05:00.160
over $880,000 in unpaid
payroll taxes related to a deal

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.760
he made to bring his law
firm out of bankruptcy.

00:05:02.760 --> 00:05:05.800
In October, a judge
ordered Avenatti to pay

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.780
almost five million dollars to
a former law partner of his.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.120
Now all of that paled in
comparison with what happened

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.580
in the middle of November.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.810
Avenatti was arrested in West Los Angeles

00:05:16.810 --> 00:05:20.210
on suspicion of domestic violence.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.920
Now Avenatti vehemently denied the charges

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.137
saying at the time, quote,
"I have never been physically

00:05:26.137 --> 00:05:28.727
"abusive in my life nor was I last night.

00:05:28.727 --> 00:05:31.477
"Any accusations to the
contrary are fabricated

00:05:31.477 --> 00:05:34.307
"and meant to do harm to my reputation.

00:05:34.307 --> 00:05:37.650
"I look forward to
being fully exonerated."

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:38.490
End quote.

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.350
The Los Angeles District Attorney's office

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.010
declined to file felony
domestic violence charges

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.270
against him, choosing
instead to refer the case

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.720
to the city attorney's office

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:49.580
for consideration of misdemeanor charges.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:52.420
And that case is still ongoing.

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:54.900
But, politically speaking,
the damage is done.

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.630
A scheduled appearance for
the Vermont Democratic Party

00:05:57.630 --> 00:05:59.910
was canceled and Avenatti hasn't been seen

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:02.410
on cable TV for weeks.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:04.380
For a time, even Daniels turned on him

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.330
saying she would drop him as her lawyer

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.330
if the domestic abuse
allegations were true

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:12.300
and suggesting that Avenatti
sued Trump against her wishes.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.100
Now don't worry, you can sleep tonight

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.170
because that fight has apparently ended

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.210
as Daniels tweeted this about she

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.670
and Avenatti on Sunday night.

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.587
Quote, "We are going to kick ass together

00:06:21.587 --> 00:06:23.330
"on two coasts tomorrow."

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:26.370
Well all may be well in the
world of Avenatti and Daniels,

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:29.830
but his presidential prospects
aren't going to recovery

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.200
so quickly and they
might not recover at all.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.057
Politico ran a piece
recently headline quote,

00:06:34.057 --> 00:06:35.770
"Avenatti Crashes and Burns."

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:36.972
End quote.

00:06:36.972 --> 00:06:38.080
Now I tweeted the piece out,
thought it was interesting.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.130
Avenatti himself wasn't
too happy with my decision

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:44.447
and said this, quote, "Chris
hasn't kept up in three years.

00:06:44.447 --> 00:06:46.417
"And don't expect anything
to change this cycle

00:06:46.417 --> 00:06:48.027
"because he's still sleeping."

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.831
Which, maybe.

00:06:51.831 --> 00:06:53.390
I mean a world in which
Donald Trump is President,

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:57.360
nothing is impossible, but
Avenatti looks more and more

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.200
like another version of
the current President

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:02.290
and I'm skeptical that
Democrats will nominate

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:05.950
their own version of Trump in 2020.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.073
And that is the point.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:12.330
We make new episodes
twice a week every week.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:14.630
Tune in on Tuesdays and
Thursdays for the latest

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:17.193
in hot and fresh political content.

